WEBVTT

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.430
Who's that?

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:22.720
No way...

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.860
Is that...

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.370
...a girl's silhouette?

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.940
Furuichi-dono, shall I wash your back?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.300
No, thanks!

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.860
Oh...

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.970
Then, if you'll pardon me.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.940
Don't you dare blush!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.480
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.190
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:03.130
But this baby is no ordinary baby...

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:04.020
It is a baby...

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.710
...Furuichi-dono!

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.880
Get out!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.020
<b>The Delinquents have Changed into Swimsuits</b>

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:02.790
So you see, I can't bear the 
big guy's SH any more...

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.580
<b>Furuichi-dono</b>

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.750
Sexy Herbal Supplements, huh?

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.090
Sexual harassment...

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.210
Well, what's so wrong with being loved?

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.470
Plenty!

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.420
He's a demon!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.260
And he's an old <i>dude</i>!

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:21.680
Until you hurry up and find 
someone to dump Baby Beel off on,

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.440
he'll be squatting at my place forever!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:28.150
But there aren't any more 
strong guys at Ishiyama...

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:33.130
No. There's still the 
final member of the TKKH.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.110
Tojo Hidetora!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.200
The rumors claim he's the 
strongest in Ishiyama.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:45.890
Like how he wiped out 350 people 
from Suppon High all by himself...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:51.390
Or how he beat the leader of the most 
powerful JD school in Hokkaido, Kegani High,

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.960
in only 2 seconds!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.180
Anyway, he's got plenty of legends about him.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.510
Interesting.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.520
Let's go check this guy out.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:13.140
But he's always doing odd-jobs and 
hardly ever comes to school, I hear.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.120
Go find him, Furuichi!

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:19.730
Oh?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.040
Oga-chan is looking for Tojo?

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.090
I guess the last battle is finally here.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:28.260
I don't care how strong Oga is, I don't 
think he'll be able to beat Tojo.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:33.800
Either way, neither of them have 
any interest in uniting Ishiyama.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:37.880
It'd be best for the two of 
them to crush each other.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.610
That'd be nice.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:49.950
Himekawa!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:51.340
Yo...

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.210
Oga's searching for Tojo, is he?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.840
How do you know?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:58.160
Well, I'm looking forward to it.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:02.820
I'm sure Oga will beat Tojo for me, no doubt.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.800
<b>Part Timers Wanted
Salary: 830 yen+
Qualifications: 18 and older
Time: 5 hours+ a day
Special Note: Travel Expenses Paid
Looking Especially for Energetic, Cheerful Workers</b>

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.890
I did some searching.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.200
<b>Beach House Fujitsubo
Ishiyama Beach</b>

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.410
This is where Tojo is working part-time now.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.270
Tell Oga for me.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:15.910
A beach house?

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:17.860
Beach house?!

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.510
Girls in swimsuits!

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:37.270
No, more importantly... If Baby Beel 
comes with him, then Hilda-san will, too!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:38.520
In that case...

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:40.990
...I'll get to see Hilda-san in a swimsuit!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.750
A Demon World swimsuit...

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:47.990
I'm sure it'll put any swimsuit 
in the Human World to shame!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.810
What kind of swimsuit?

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:53.790
Seashells?

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.630
Coconuts?

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.480
No, no, no...

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:03.300
It's from the Demon World, so it wouldn't 
be a wimpy swimsuit like those!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.150
It's gotta be a sexier, 
extremely dangerous swimsuit!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.720
Himekawa-senpai, thank you very much!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:13.560
S-Sure...

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.010
The beach, the beach!

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.170
Swimsuits, swimsuits!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:19.590
Hey, Oga! I know where Tojo is!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:27.270
Is he planning to get Tojo to beat Oga?

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:30.500
It has nothing to do with us, Madame.

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:35.350
Tojo or whoever, they can crush 
each other all they want.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:41.270
I don't care how strong Oga Tatsumi 
is... He can't beat the Tojo I know.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.510
Unsatisfying...

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.110
Isn't there anyone that's 
a real challenge out there?

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.260
You sure did a real number on them.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:01.980
And thanks to it, I got fired 
from my hard-won beach house job.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.290
Well, we can just search again.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.290
I had hoped you'd score 
me some free yakisoba.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.080
Sorry 'bout that, Kaoru.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:15.200
Anyway, isn't there someone out 
there that's a match for me?

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.350
Well, about that, Tojo-san...

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.640
There's one guy that's promising.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.770
Oga Tatsumi.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:31.880
He's a first year at our school, but he's 
beat Kanzaki, Himekawa, and even Kunieda.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:33.680
Oh?

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:40.630
The beach.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.000
Yes, the beach.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:49.370
Wait, isn't this the shore where we 
got rid of Baby Beel's "monsoon"?

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:52.800
Yeah... Maybe I'll pass on taking a dip.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.440
But anyway, we didn't come for a swim!

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.200
We came to look for Tojo!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.470
Plus there's one more important thing...

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:05.540
Erm... Did Hilda-san bring a swimsuit?

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:12.760
Oh, yeah... She said she brought some 
kind of amazing Demon World swimsuit...

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.240
Hilda-san... amazing swimsuit...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.430
Do not stare like that.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:23.990
It is embarrassing...

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.890
My dreams are ever growing.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.330
So, let us change into a swimsuit.

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.440
You're going to change there?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:37.970
It's unacceptable?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.630
It's totally fine!

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.540
Rather, it's the perfect place!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:55.660
Do not stare like that.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:57.310
It is embarrassing.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.470
It's you?

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.790
Furuichi-dono, if you want to stare...

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.150
What are you doing?

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:15.390
Let's go, Furuichi.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.070
Beach house Fujitsubo...

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:20.380
This is it.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.160
Hey, you!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:26.150
You have to get in line!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:34.400
Uh, we didn't come to buy Yakisoba.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.560
Wait, are you the new part-timers?

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.020
I've been waiting!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.050
This way!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.370
Hurry up!

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.140
No, that's not it!

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.630
Papa... How much longer?

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.570
Just a little longer...

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.280
It'll be weady wight away!

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.510
Wait, what are we doing?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.550
Why don't we just wait here until Tojo comes?

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:07.790
After all, we don't know 
what Tojo looks like...

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:09.470
Here, thanks for waiting!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.120
Who's next?

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.370
Hold the ginger on mine, please!

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:16.590
I'd like an extra large!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.590
Coming right up!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.000
Ooh, how cute!

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.470
It's a baby!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.080
Uh, is this gonna be okay?

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.140
I'm in heaven...

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:44.490
I've got a harem!

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.870
What is he doing?

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.670
I thought I'd finally gotten 
Tojo and him together...

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:57.320
It seems like Tojo's been fired.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:58.670
What?

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:03.050
Then what did we come here for?

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:08.940
Kanzaki-kun, they have some amazing yogurti!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:12.410
Look, it's squid-flavor!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.170
Shiroyama, try a little.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:17.350
Here.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.600
Kunieda?

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.040
I ended up being worried and coming here...

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.610
You alone, Miss?

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:39.980
Wanna play with us?

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:53.900
Great work!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.760
You guys are great!

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.110
A big success!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:01.890
Um... When will Tojo be coming?

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:06.290
Tojo-kun... He was fired yesterday.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:07.090
Fired?

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.700
He fought with some customers.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:12.750
See that?

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.260
Did Tojo bend that?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:24.140
Well, I called them customers, 
but they were a bunch of thugs.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.940
What, are you friends of his?

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:30.330
Oh? You're with Tojo, are ya?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.140
They're back!

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.940
You did a real number on us yesterday.

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.700
Where're you hidin' Tojo?

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:44.240
Bring him, or we beat you in his place!

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.120
Shut up.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.400
W-Why you...

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:14.680
Well, I guess this was a swing and a miss...

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:19.110
Hey, Ishiyama's Queen showed up over there!

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.730
For real?

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.830
That spells trouble!

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:25.480
Better than trouble, I hear 
she's in a dangerous swimsuit!

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.300
The Queen is here? And in a swimsuit?

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:30.950
Hey Oga, hurry up!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.000
Off we go!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.000
Indeed, you are Ishiyama's Queen.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.970
Everyone is staring at you, Miwa-san.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.490
Definitely dangerous, all right.

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.780
Let's pretend we didn't see that.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:56.890
I do believe everyone has arrived... 
This could get quite lively.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.230
I have no interest in weaklings.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.310
The issue is with this Tojo person.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.490
<b>Arm Wrestling
100 Yen a Try</b>

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:13.970
It seems that Oga person 
has shown up on this beach.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.310
Oh?

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.490
Things are gonna get fun.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.860
Starfish shuriken!

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:43.900
Sea cucumber kunai!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:45.830
You have skills, sir!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.100
As do you!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.140
What is this?

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:51.780
Take that!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.170
Queen?

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:14.260
Oga Tatsumi... Looks like you burn easily...

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.310
Sheesh... Why?

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:34.230
It's the beach! If you're gonna come, you 
could show a little more skin than that!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.280
You over there, young man...

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.460
Yes! Young man here, at your service!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.270
This is from Hime-chan.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:45.660
Hime-chan?

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.420
You mean, Himekawa?

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.810
Electric jellyfish?

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.520
That's where Tojo is.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:02.270
You're really good at this.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.390
What am I doing?

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:10.090
Why are you so good at caring for a baby?

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.640
T-That's not true...

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:15.560
Oga!

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.620
I know where Tojo is!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:18.700
You do?

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.210
All right! Let's go, Baby Beel!

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:23.710
What's wrong, Baby Beel?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.710
You wish to do that next, young Master?

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:31.810
Do we have a watermelon?

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.070
In that case, I...

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.020
...will become the melon.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:38.800
Actually, splitting you 
here would be a problem.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.460
Then perhaps I shall split 
myself from the start?

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:43.600
Don't split yourself!

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:49.970
What in the world are they doing?

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:56.460
Kanzaki-san... Perhaps we 
shouldn't expect much here.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.000
<b>Store closed</b>

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:10.080
Look at that bastard Oga...

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.450
Not bad, I say.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:17.510
<b>Electric Jellyfish</b>

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.040
Tojo? He finished up just earlier.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.720
Crap... There's never 
gonna be an end to this.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.770
I know, Oga! Write him a letter of challenge.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.830
Then deliver it to Tojo.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.770
<b>Letter of Challenge</b>

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.220
I'll be waiting in front of the 
two rocks tonight at 5 PM.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:35.270
This'll do?

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.610
Sure, although you write at an 
elementary school level...

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.790
But we don't know what Tojo looks like.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.570
How should we pass it to him?

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:46.020
In that case...

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.220
Hey, Kunieda!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:51.730
Here.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.630
What?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:18:00.320
Wait at 5 PM by the two rocks?

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:04.660
Could this be... a confession?

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:07.390
Confessing under the sunset sky?

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.920
What'll I do?

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:17.700
In this outfit... Maybe I should 
have brought a swimsuit after all...

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:24.430
But I don't want to be thought of as a woman 
who seduces men using sexy swimwear...

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.100
Would you find Tojo and pass this to him?

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:29.470
<b>Letter of Challenge</b>

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.720
He left me with this Letter of Challenge.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.920
What am I doing?

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.410
Hey, Kunieda.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.570
What are you waiting for?

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:51.020
Hurry up, find Tojo, and hand 
him that Letter of Challenge.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.930
I'm not going to join in on your schemes.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.930
It's too dangerous to let those two fight.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.070
What the hell are you saying?

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.700
Well, the rest is up to you.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.570
G-Good luck with Tojo.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:18.630
Is that a Letter of Challenge to Tojo-san?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.740
It's almost 5 o'clock.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.770
Yeah! I can't wait to fight.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.800
Just you wait, Baby Beel!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:43.180
We'll meet Tojo soon!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.820
Wait, Oga!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:54.860
Who are you?

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.480
MK5!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:57.840
The MK5!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.200
What do you want?

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.300
I'm in a hurry, you know.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.300
Why don't you join us?

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:05.670
We'll welcome you as our sixth member.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:11.120
As the MK6, we'll crush Tojo together!

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.520
No one will be able to stop us!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.740
Out of my way!

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.080
He ain't coming.

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.630
Is he scared?

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.650
It's best if he doesn't show.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.470
Demons, Catapult, Bremen...

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:04.720
Looks like all the gangs have 
joined up to settle things.

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:07.260
Payback for yesterday and today?

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:12.370
Ah, well... Guess I'll 
crush them instead of Oga!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.530
Damn, I'm already really late.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:28.760
That's...

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:31.260
Tojo's already left.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.630
You didn't seem like you were coming.

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.910
Did Tojo do this?

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:40.230
Yes... All by himself.

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.160
He's a monster.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:44.500
He's not someone you can 
beat in a fair fight.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:49.060
Interesting... Perfect!

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:53.120
I can't wait 'till I meet the guy!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.990
Oww!

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.340
Well, I did get a nice tan.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:12.690
What the...

00:24:01.650 --> 00:24:02.520
Aloha!

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:05.210
Furuichi here! It's what we've all 
been waiting for, summer vacation!

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:09.030
Next week we'll present you with an adventure 
love story from a tropical island!

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:10.300
Woohoo!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:11.580
...wait, what?

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:12.950
This is the municipal pool!

00:24:12.950 --> 00:24:13.940
Why?!

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.500
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:16.500 --> 00:24:18.100
You're not a bad specimen of a man!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:20.480
Wait, I can't give up yet!

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:22.920
This time, I'll see Hilda-san in a 
swimsuit, and the Queen in a swimsuit...

00:24:22.920 --> 00:24:24.080
There might even be a wardrobe malfunction!

00:24:24.460 --> 00:24:26.440
If you wanna see that, 
take a look at Baby Beel.

00:24:27.560 --> 00:24:28.780
He's already lettin' it all hang out.
